All three accepted findings from `gmail-quota-review.md` are fixed in the existing uncommitted diff. No commit, push, or unrelated-file changes; `src-tauri/Cargo.toml`, `mise.local.toml`, `~/.config/email-os`, Keychain, and real Google APIs were untouched (the `src-tauri/Cargo.toml` modification is pre-existing from the base diff and was left as-is).

